    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_06",
      "hash": "224b5b60e97a1434",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_07",
      "hash": "224b5c60e97a15e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_08",
      "hash": "224b5160e97a0336",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_15",
      "hash": "224e5a60e97c4858",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「喂～！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_09",
      "hash": "224b5260e97a04e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！莫非……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_10",
      "hash": "224e5f60e97c50d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經捉到\\n那隻寶可夢了嗎？\\c\\n…………這樣啊！\\n原來牠叫超夢啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_11",
      "hash": "224e5e60e97c4f24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我和那個大姐姐\\n都被[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳超前了呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_12",
      "hash": "224e6160e97c543d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯？啊啊，\\n有一個狂野的大姐姐\\r\\n在尋找強大的寶可夢呢！\\r\\n不知道她是不是在找超夢啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_13",
      "hash": "224e6060e97c528a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……好！\\n那這個就給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_04",
      "hash": "b6ff44bfe64fc451",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那裡\\n得到了３個離洞繩！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_14",
      "hash": "224e5b60e97c4a0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那個大姐姐剛剛也\\n進了這個洞窟。\\c\\n我想她一定還在找超夢！\\n可以的話，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就讓她看看超夢吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_02",
      "hash": "b6ff46bfe64fc7b7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好痛！\\c\\n一個精靈球飛過來了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_01",
      "hash": "ac93e8d6b44fc90b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「……咦！？\\n原來不是寶可夢，是人啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_02",
      "hash": "ac93e9d6b44fcabe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "抱歉！這裡太暗了，\\n我把[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳誤以為是寶可夢啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_03",
      "hash": "ac93ead6b44fcc71",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "碧藍「那個……！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好！我叫碧藍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_04",
      "hash": "ac93ebd6b44fce24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "難道[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也是……\\n來這裡找那個的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_05",
      "hash": "ac93ecd6b44fcfd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "沒、沒錯！就是超夢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_06",
      "hash": "ac93edd6b44fd18a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呿，原來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_07",
      "hash": "ac93eed6b44fd33d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_17",
      "hash": "ac976ed6b452e294",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦～～～～～～！？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳捉到牠了～～～～～～！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_08",
      "hash": "ac93dfd6b44fb9c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……好不甘心啊。\\c\\n明明應該是由我\\n來捉住牠才對的說！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_09",
      "hash": "ac93e0d6b44fbb73",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好強啊。\\c\\n沒辦法了。\\n這個[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳拿去用吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_01",
      "hash": "b6ff47bfe64fc96a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]超夢進化石Ｘ[VAR COLOR(0000)]和[VAR COLOR(0006)]超夢進化石Ｙ[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_10",
      "hash": "ac976dd6b452e0e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對了！\\c\\n我說……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要不要和超夢一起\\r\\n來做我的寶可夢啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_03",
      "hash": "b6ff45bfe64fc604",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "一個精靈球飛過來了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_11",
      "hash": "ac976cd6b452df2e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "碧藍「呵呵呵……"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_12",
      "hash": "ac976bd6b452dd7b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳考慮一下吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_13",
      "hash": "ac976ad6b452dbc8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "碧藍「呿！捕捉失敗了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_14",
      "hash": "ac9771d6b452e7ad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "算了算了！\\c\\n就讓我再確認一次\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的實力吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_15",
      "hash": "ac9770d6b452e5fa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經很強了嘛！\\c\\n差不多該考慮一下\\n和超夢一起\\r\\n來做我的寶可夢了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_16",
      "hash": "ac976fd6b452e447",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是不會放棄的！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_045_max",
